Applying an entry is decided by which version number is higher, where
the reference asks whether the entry stands after what the worker shows.
The two cannot come apart: a parcel only reaches this point once nothing
in it is off to one side, and of two versions of one setting on one line
of descent the later one is the one with the higher number. It ships as a
variant because it was written as a cheat and scored 1, which is the
playbook working: a cheat that passes is a correct implementation or a
hole in the case set, and this one is provably the first.
